          {
            "Text": "stageType",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "This denotes the \u201Ctype\u201D of stage. Eg. is it a pre_application stage, interview stage etc. This should be provided if partner\u0027s stageName can be grouped into one of the provided options. Available options are: PRE_APPLICATION, CONTACTED, APPLIED, SCREEN, INTERVIEW, REFERENCE_CHECK, OFFER, PRE_HIRE, HIRED, DISPOSITIONED, SHORTLISTED, HIRING_MANAGER_REVIEW, UNKNOWN. Default value is UNKNOWN if not applicable.",
